chunks.text:
[Hyperspace and the Notstrom]
{0:00 to 1:10: a low rising synthesizer swell like a tunnel of light, the bass choir holds a deep D}
{at 1:10: one bright shimmering impact, light breaking through, then a vast open space with only the low choir chord on D}
{1:10 to 4:00: wide, calm and lonely, sparse glassy bells high above the choir, a dark drone}
{4:00 to 7:00: the choir slowly grows, a low rumbling pulse without a tempo, something enormous comes closer}
{7:00 to 9:00: a long rising riser and a swell towards a bright flash, then all of it settles on a sustained deep male choir chord on D}
